  "lesson": {
    "meta": "交互解题 · 公切线与幂",
    "title": "平面上两个抛物线，它们有相互垂直的对称轴且有公共焦点 $O$。设两个抛物线相交于 $A,B$ 两点。一条公切线 $l$ 与直线 $AB$ 相交于点 $C$。证明：$|OC|^{2}=|AC|\\cdot|BC|$。",
    "answerLabel": "结论",
    "answers": [
      {"label": "所证", "value": "$|OC|^{2}=|AC|\\cdot|BC|$"}
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "把公共焦点放在原点",
      "content": "<p>两抛物线的对称轴互相垂直，公共焦点为 $O$。把 $O$ 放在原点，轴分别平行于坐标轴，可写成</p><p>$$C_1:y=ax^{2}-\\dfrac{1}{4a},\\qquad C_2:x=by^{2}-\\dfrac{1}{4b}\\quad(a,b>0).$$</p><p>公共焦点 $O{{mp.O}}$，交点 $A{{mp.A}}$，$B{{mp.B}}$。</p>",
      "highlight": ["Axis", "Curve_C1", "Curve_C2", "Point_O", "Point_A", "Point_B", "Focus_O"]
    },
    {
      "title": "求出一条公切线",
      "content": "<p>$C_1$ 上斜率为 $m$ 的切线是 $y=mx-\\dfrac{m^{2}+1}{4a}$，记纵截距为 $n=-\\dfrac{m^{2}+1}{4a}$。</p><p>同一直线与 $C_2$ 相切时，$n=\\dfrac{m^{2}+1}{4bm}$。两式相等得 $m=-\\dfrac{a}{b}$，从而</p><p>$$n=-\\dfrac{a^{2}+b^{2}}{4ab^{2}}.$$</p><p>整理得公切线</p><p>$$l:4a^{2}bx+4ab^{2}y+(a^{2}+b^{2})=0.$$</p>",
      "highlight": ["Curve_C1", "Curve_C2", "Line_l", "Point_O", "Point_A", "Point_B"]
    },
    {
      "title": "交点与公弦的参数",
      "content": "<p>令 $s=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2\\sqrt{ab}}$，则 $s^{2}=\\dfrac{1}{2ab}$。直接代入两条方程可验证</p><p>$$A\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2a}+s,\\dfrac{1}{2b}+s\\right),\\qquad B\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2a}-s,\\dfrac{1}{2b}-s\\right)$$</p><p>是两抛物线的交点。因此直线 $AB$ 可写成</p><p>$$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2a}+\\lambda,\\dfrac{1}{2b}+\\lambda\\right),$$</p><p>$A,B$ 分别对应 $\\lambda=s$ 与 $\\lambda=-s$。</p>",
      "highlight": ["Curve_C1", "Curve_C2", "Line_AB", "Point_A", "Point_B", "Point_O"]
    },
    {
      "title": "公切线与公弦的交点 C",
      "content": "<p>把 $AB$ 的参数式代入 $l$：</p><p>$$4a^{2}b\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2a}+\\lambda\\right)+4ab^{2}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2b}+\\lambda\\right)+(a^{2}+b^{2})=0.$$</p><p>化简为 $4ab(a+b)\\lambda+(a^{2}+4ab+b^{2})=0$，故</p><p>$$\\lambda_C=-\\dfrac{a^{2}+4ab+b^{2}}{4ab(a+b)}.$$</p><p>对应点即 $C$。图中 $C{{mp.C}}$。$|\\lambda_C|>s$，所以 $C$ 在线段 $AB$ 的外侧。</p>",
      "highlight": ["Line_l", "Line_AB", "Point_A", "Point_B", "Point_C", "Point_O"]
    },
    {
      "title": "计算 |OC| 的平方",
      "content": "<p>由参数式，</p><p>$$C_x=\\dfrac{1}{2a}+\\lambda_C,\\qquad C_y=\\dfrac{1}{2b}+\\lambda_C.$$</p><p>两式相加、相减得 $C_x+C_y=-\\dfrac{1}{a+b}$，$C_x-C_y=\\dfrac{b-a}{2ab}$。于是</p><p>$$|OC|^{2}=\\dfrac{(C_x+C_y)^{2}+(C_x-C_y)^{2}}{2}=\\dfrac{(a^{2}+b^{2})^{2}}{8a^{2}b^{2}(a+b)^{2}}.$$</p>",
      "highlight": ["Line_l", "Seg_OC", "Point_O", "Point_C", "Point_A", "Point_B"]
    },
    {
      "title": "比较 |AC|·|BC| 与 |OC|²",
      "content": "<p>沿方向 $(1,1)$，参数差为 $\\Delta\\lambda$ 的两点距离是 $\\sqrt{2}\\,|\\Delta\\lambda|$。因此</p><p>$$|AC|\\cdot|BC|=2\\,|\\lambda_C^{2}-s^{2}|=2(\\lambda_C^{2}-s^{2}).$$</p><p>把 $\\lambda_C$ 与 $s^{2}=\\dfrac{1}{2ab}$ 代入，</p><p>$$\\lambda_C^{2}-s^{2}=\\dfrac{(a^{2}+4ab+b^{2})^{2}-8ab(a+b)^{2}}{16a^{2}b^{2}(a+b)^{2}}=\\dfrac{(a^{2}+b^{2})^{2}}{16a^{2}b^{2}(a+b)^{2}},$$</p><p>故 $|AC|\\cdot|BC|=\\dfrac{(a^{2}+b^{2})^{2}}{8a^{2}b^{2}(a+b)^{2}}$。它与 $|OC|^{2}$ 的差为 ${{answer}}$，所以</p><p>$$|OC|^{2}=|AC|\\cdot|BC|.$$</p>",
      "highlight": ["Line_AB", "Line_l", "Seg_AC", "Seg_BC", "Seg_OC", "Point_O", "Point_A", "Point_B", "Point_C"]
    }
  ],
